## 其一：#[reflect(opaque)] 缺 Clone → E0277（r2 首次 check）

```text
error[E0277]: the trait bound `OpaqueWrapC: Clone` is not satisfied
   --> src\lib.rs:136:10
    |
136 | #[derive(Reflect)]
    |          ^^^^^^^ the trait `Clone` is not implemented for `OpaqueWrapC`
    |
    = note: this error originates in the derive macro `Reflect` (in Nightly builds, run with `-Z macro-backtrace` for more details)
help: consider annotating `OpaqueWrapC` with `#[derive(Clone)]`
    |
138 + #[derive(Clone)]
139 + struct OpaqueWrapC(f32);
    |
...
error: could not compile `probe-e` (lib) due to 3 previous errors
```

（该轮共 3 error，其余 2 条为同 derive 展开的重复 bound 报告，日志仅显示首条完整块。）

## 其二：内联 &arc.read() 传参 → E0716（修 Clone 后第二次 check，bin 侧）

```text
error[E0716]: temporary value dropped while borrowed
  --> src\main.rs:72:43
   |
72 |     let ser = ReflectSerializer::new(&v, &arc.read());
   |                                           ^^^^^^^^^^^ - temporary value is freed at the end of this statement
   |
```

修复：守卫显式绑定 `let reg = arc.read();` 后传 `&reg`（终态源码 main.rs R2c 内注释）。
